    "body": "@wajsic NICE! Can you share the CoreML file with us? 🤣 just kidding; very happy for you (and your studio)!\n\nI have actually been playing devil's advocate because I wanted to be proven wrong, since I would love to use this in my own music app. Unfortunately for me, it looks like the only way I will ever (as an indie developer) be able to utilize the technology is if a company licenses their CoreML models to me for some cut of the app's profits. Oh well 😄 ",
